&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;iwy669&quot; data-start=&quot;2713&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;Why Join Epic?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2732&quot; data-end=&quot;3006&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;At Epic, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to build products that inspire millions of kids to discover the joy of reading. You&#39;ll work alongside talented teammates across the globe, solve meaningful technical challenges, and help shape the future of digital learning for children.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Epic Kids is the leading digital reading platform built for kids 12 and under, trusted by millions of children, educators, and families around the world. Our mission is to inspire a lifelong love of reading by providing unlimited access to thousands of high-quality books, videos, and educational content through a safe and engaging experience. We combine technology, storytelling, and learning innovation to help every child become a confident reader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Epic, you&#39;ll join a collaborative and fast-paced global team passionate about building meaningful products that make a real impact on children&#39;s education and literacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Full-Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;owns features end-to-end across Epic&#39;s web application -- Angular front-end, PHP/Symfony and Go services, MySQL -- and helps raise the engineering bar for the team. We hire for engineering strength over experience with any specific stack; strong engineers ramp quickly on ours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a fully remote,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;India&lt;/strong&gt;-based role, requiring close collaboration with a global engineering team that has members in the US, India and China.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship features end-to-end across the full stack, from spec to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound decisions on architecture, data modeling, and API design; document trade-offs and align stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive code quality through code review and testing across front-end and back-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior and mid-level engineers through code review and pairing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design reviews, RFCs, and architecture discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools to accelerate delivery, holding generated code to the same quality bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in production support -- investigations, post-mortems, and systemic fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 years of professional software engineering, owning complex, cross-team work autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong front-end engineering with a modern component framework (Angular a plus), plus solid TypeScript/JavaScript and UI fundamentals (HTML, CSS, accessibility).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong back-end engineering in a modern server-side language (we use PHP and Go).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relational-database proficiency -- data modeling, performant queries, and indexing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating production APIs (REST or gRPC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with Git, pull-request workflows, and CI/CD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with our stack (Angular, PHP/Symfony, Go, MySQL) a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a service migration between languages/runtimes (e.g., PHP to Go) in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Tera for server-side templating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker and Kubernetes (GKE) at the application-developer level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud-platform experience -- GCP preferred, AWS or Azure acceptable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating against an observability stack (New Relic, Datadog, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of children&#39;s-privacy compliance frameworks (COPPA, FERPA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

